  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gohugoio/hugo/zipball/v0.170.1",
  "body": "The primary motivation for this release is a bug fix for a performance regression introduces in [v0.166.0](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases/tag/v0.166.0) where we improved the `return` keyword in `partial` templates. Note that this was not an issue if you don't use this keyword and also only an issue for bigger sites.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* deps: Upgrade github.com/bep/imagemeta v1.1.1 => v1.1.2 e6d7bcba @bep \r\n* tpl/tplimpl: Don't add file context to partial return sentinel errors 5f34065b @bep #15604 \r\n* images: Add fgColor and bgColor options to images.QR and the qr shortcode 93be9f1f @bep #15600 \r\n* tpl/tplimpl: Cleanup vimeo shortcode comments and arg logic 6c6b1eea @jmooring \r\n* Delete hugolib/integrationtest_builder_test.go b8765e1f @bep \r\n* tests: Address deprecation errors 7a15e872 @jmooring \r\n\r\n\r\n",
